{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚（30日）10時許，警方接獲途人報案，一名外籍男子在油麻地上海街213號一條後巷形跡可疑，持有疑似曲尺手槍的物品，繼而離開。外籍男子進入佐敦廟街192號一間酒吧，負責人見狀報案。</p><p>警方接報後大為緊張，警員帶齊裝備到場截獲該名男子，檢獲一把懷疑氣槍，以涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」罪名拘捕該名36歲男子，案件交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第六隊跟進。</p><p>據了解，被捕男子來自澳洲，持護照到港，身上帶有酒氣；就現場所見，疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車，被捕男子在油麻地分區警署羈留期間，懷疑突然情緒激動，毁壞牆壁及一個煙霧探測器，另涉「刑事毁壞」罪名被捕。</p><p>根據網上圖片，反恐特勤隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備頭盔和防彈衣等裝備，部份警員更持槍，並在樓梯口戒備。</p><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124265583939584013895.jpeg/e_p4R0_TvkTEEeFnxiwrDpEYrynD3Y8CVjexSlY3sUo\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備，部份警員更持槍，並在樓梯口戒備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124358965923840381072.jpeg/dolo4xwk8pVL76FBq2h1QvyDsD91KpcKVTTeslU03rI\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備，部份警員更持槍，並在樓梯口戒備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124741566140416312678.jpeg/t3bygyu4tImC4DClzHk3ZvKF5ecqWKZuF7XzcBe183A\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124744451952640138702.jpeg/dnBvxoYu1jnLvMahv7aPMYJu9vVRPOTDLg9T_C4PU_w\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124747312599040513490.jpeg/B1eLOqkNyHTMTDC8z7di3D9arqmSswj-WieXnVonl50\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124749988696064690185.jpeg/10LUjxei0oqdHBirhUfzh0qTdjOjbKzQx4t1_seLdf4\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124752778039296673805.jpeg/WlEJbVLgrLpDp3FkuWl9C4ikJIQSFGVBcFRPa3BUT2s\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@handsomebb999圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182133475931590656836250.jpeg/oij--qy-YWHlyzPw0BjOLx9YS0ghlmmcmHkuhZh5LoU\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@handsomebb999圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員持槍。（Threads@julian_nibba圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182184635761692672387490.jpeg/DhRQCXXgXInL-nnhd3GKIkFQvqTOpkrKhV4J5IVeCeQ\"/><figcaption>警員持槍。（Threads@julian_nibba圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員持槍。（Threads@julian_nibba圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182184638047719424706845.jpeg/pPSrey20bWXJTSJWqAfbjy2fpY0n_D7g1U1ZRtVNWUY\"/><figcaption>警員持槍。（Threads@julian_nibba圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員持槍。（Threads@julian_nibba圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182184640660901888395871.jpeg/qu5ZowvZ97Kr21DBcDDw4X2W_2gz8npDFAHnrBQB56w\"/><figcaption>警員持槍。（Threads@julian_nibba圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120028896497664682495.jpeg/c_v14rOh-XmtfwJeoSaTVKDR2wJBbfzEmzeuR6E3rkc\"/><figcaption>疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120032256266240370429.jpeg/L7F53ZXA9ZiE3lCbSUrwckMv9qW12AeO1VYgbO9WIGw\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120584784646144195407.jpeg/u-5nhtgBdgwizroKSWu4-9d7JIs91hgKn0onhqVKJ4Y\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120580510519296980265.jpeg/1zmtx8vqbVB6dfVf9GZ5sMveQHrD3EWKuRWzKoMVsyo\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120576811012096371628.jpeg/YaY6vCd1WRmGhdjxKM3X1ABVuE_1F6Xd_u2YS8TtmEs\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T22:40:14.201742+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":840,"images":16,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}